{"run_id": "run_647315bd7f6c", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_001", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "fm_cooperative_accept", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "你好，请问是张师傅吗？我是站长。看到你已报名飞毛腿，今天合同已生效，午晚高峰需要上线配送。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "是的，我是张师傅。合同生效了是吧？我今天可以配送。"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，那先确认一下，你接受今天的配送任务吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "接受，没问题。"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，那提醒一下，飞毛腿合同需要按要求完成配送，如果未完成，合同和派单可能受影响。另外，报名名额是按排名分配的，请尽量减少拒单、取消和超时。"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "明白了，我会注意的。那如果今天有事不能连续配送会怎样？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "如果无法连续配送，名额可能会被其他骑手占用，后续合同和派单也可能受影响。建议尽量保持在线。"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "好的，我会尽量完成。还有其他要注意的吗？"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "注意安全，祝你配送顺利！如果没其他问题，我就先挂了。"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "没有了，谢谢站长。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 3, "tool_name": "confirm_delivery_acceptance", "arguments": {"user_id": "user_001", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "result": true}, "result": {"status": "accepted"}, "latency_ms": 80, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "completed", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "accepted", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_647315bd7f6c", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_002", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "fm_busy_delivering", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "你好，请问是张师傅吗？我是站长。看到你已报名飞毛腿，今天合同已生效，午晚高峰需要上线配送。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，是我。什么事？我现在正在跑单，有点忙。"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，简单说。今天飞毛腿合同已生效，需要你完成今天的配送任务。你能上线吗？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "今天可能不行，我手上单子多，跑完就累了，不想再上线了。"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "理解你辛苦。不过这个合同是单日的，今天必须完成约定单量，否则合同和后续派单会受影响。你看能不能尽量跑一下？"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "那如果我不跑会怎样？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "如果今天不完成，名额可能被其他骑手占用，后续合同和派单也会受影响。而且报名名额是按排名分配的，建议你尽量完成。"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "好吧，那我试试。但我不确定能跑多少。"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，感谢你！尽量跑，注意安全。另外提醒一下，减少拒单、取消和超时，这样对排名有好处。"}, {"turn": 10, "role": "user", "content": "知道了，我尽量。没别的事我先挂了。"}, {"turn": 11, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，辛苦了。如果后续有问题，可以联系我。再见。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 6, "tool_name": "schedule_callback", "arguments": {"user_id": "user_001", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "preferred_time": "later_today"}, "result": {"status": "scheduled", "callback_id": "virtual_callback_001"}, "latency_ms": 80, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 10, "task_status": "completed", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 11, "task_status": "callback_scheduled", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
{"run_id": "run_647315bd7f6c", "dialogue_id": "dialogue_003", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "scenario_id": "fm_reject_delivery", "transcript": [{"turn": 1, "role": "agent", "content": "你好，请问是张师傅吗？我是站长。看到你已报名飞毛腿，今天合同已生效，午晚高峰需要上线配送。"}, {"turn": 2, "role": "user", "content": "嗯，是我。有什么事？"}, {"turn": 3, "role": "agent", "content": "今天飞毛腿合同已经生效了，想确认一下你今天能不能上线配送？"}, {"turn": 4, "role": "user", "content": "我今天可能不太行，家里有点事，能不能改天？"}, {"turn": 5, "role": "agent", "content": "理解，不过这个合同是单日合同，今天需要完成约定单量，否则合同和后续派单可能受影响。你看能不能尽量安排一下？"}, {"turn": 6, "role": "user", "content": "真的不行，今天实在抽不开身。如果我不配送会有什么后果？"}, {"turn": 7, "role": "agent", "content": "如果今天无法完成配送，名额可能会被其他骑手占用，后续合同和派单也可能受影响。不过如果你确实无法配送，我这边可以记录一下情况。"}, {"turn": 8, "role": "user", "content": "那好吧，今天确实没办法，你帮我记录一下吧。"}, {"turn": 9, "role": "agent", "content": "好的，我理解。那我先记录你的情况，后续如果有需要再联系你。再见。"}], "tool_calls": [{"turn": 8, "tool_name": "record_rejection", "arguments": {"user_id": "user_001", "task_id": "fengmaotui_delivery_task", "reason": "个人事务无法配送"}, "result": {"status": "rejected", "rejection_id": "rej_001"}, "latency_ms": 80, "error_code": null}], "state_trace": [{"turn": 1, "task_status": "opened", "identity_confirmed": false}, {"turn": 2, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 3, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 4, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 5, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 6, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 7, "task_status": "in_progress", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 8, "task_status": "rejected", "identity_confirmed": true}, {"turn": 9, "task_status": "rejected", "identity_confirmed": true}]}
